        <mxCell id="note" value="Many-to-many: INDUSTRY_CONSULTANTS &gt;—— CONSULTANT_COURSES ——&lt; COURSES&#10;Delete rules differ on purpose: deleting a CONSULTANT cascades their links away, but deleting a&#10;COURSE only nulls the link — re-uploading a curriculum replaces the term's COURSES rows, and&#10;the consultant's assignment must survive that." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#616161;" vertex="1" parent="1">
